body: "Source report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1450. Reproduction uses the published 2026.10.12 SDK on Node 24; fieldType in the generic schema action persists the intended number type, while documented type in schemaAddField persists string. Preserve generic-action compatibility and default string behavior."
